## Answer Format

| Type | Format | Example |
|------|--------|---------|
| Single number | digits only | `2273.8` |
| Percentage | number + % | `12.34%` |
| Regression | [s, −i] | `[0.123, −0.234]` |
| Multi-value | [a, b%] | `[1234567, 12.34%]` |

**Formatting:** Use Unicode minus (−) for negatives. `round()` uses conventional 0.5→up.

